  "body": "Perfectly positioned with the reserve right at your back door. This exceptional near-new home is set in the beautiful community of Ara Hills, offers modern comfort, light-filled living, and an easy connection to the surrounding reserve. With four spacious bedrooms and 2.5 upmarket bathrooms across a well-designed 174sqm (approx.) floor plan, it delivers a relaxed lifestyle on a low maintenance 210sqm (approx.) section, with a luxury feel throughout the home.\r\n\r\nFeatures at a Glance:\r\n*  Open-plan kitchen, dining, and living with generous natural light\r\n*  Modern kitchen with engineered benchtops, quality appliances, and great storage\r\n*  Ranch Slider opens to a sunny deck and fully fenced garden overlooking Redwood Park & Reserve\r\n*  Separate laundry nook in the internal-access garage\r\n*  plus a convenient guest toilet\r\n*  Three upstairs bedrooms and a stylish family bathroom\r\n*  Master suite with walk-in wardrobe, ensuite, and private balcony\r\n*  Plenty of storage throughout, from under the staircase, the passageway upstairs & downstairs and the extra cupboards in the garage\r\n*  Park access with BBQ area just steps away\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned close to schools, Orewa Beach, cafes, shops, and motorway links, this home offers comfort, convenience, and a lifestyle that's easy to enjoy. For viewing details, contact Shaun Burnett on 021 871 252",
